From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Victor Momplet <mompletvictor@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 19:48:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(food): history ranges up to a year in weekly averages,
 and a switch for the burn line

- Ranges Week / Month / 3 / 6 months / 1 year; past a month the charts plot
  one point per week (locale's first weekday) with the averages of its
  logged days, today left out.
- Tapping "Burned" in the calories legend hides or shows its line.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
